<title>UK: Nationwide sets $50 million June 2000 bond.</title>
<headline>Nationwide sets $50 million June 2000 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Creditanstalt Bankverein.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NATIONWIDE BUILDING SOCIETY</p>
<p> AMT    $50 MLN	 COUPON     5.875 PCT MATURITY    09.JUN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE  S-09.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    =	   S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN MTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
